Enumeration DiplomaType
    documentation 'The type of diploma/credential that is awarded to a student in recognition of 
                  'his/her completion of the curricular requirements.
    item Regular diploma
    item Endorsed/advanced diploma
    item Regents diploma
    item International Baccalaureate
    item Modified diploma
    item Other diploma
    item Alternative credential
    item Certificate of attendance
    item Certificate of completion
    item High school equivalency credential, other than GED
    item General Educational Development (GED) credential
    item Post graduate certificate (grade 13)
    item Career and Technical Education certificate
    item Other
    item Occupational License
    item Industry-recognized Certification
    item Apprenticeship Certificate